  "details": "Description\n\nMy microphone audio keeps cutting out during voice chat in VRChat on my HONOR X9d. Other players cannot hear me clearly because my voice repeatedly drops out. Please investigate this issue.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open VRChat on Android.\n\n2. Join a world with other players.\n\n3. Enable the microphone and speak in voice chat.\n\n4. The microphone audio repeatedly cuts out, making it difficult for other players to hear me.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: AndroidMobile (platform: Android - Mobile, store: PlayStore, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-fd13ba9fec-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-12_02-38-19.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_905e7322-9d83-42cb-bc7d-5f96ccf76e90/1/file)",
